DECLARATIONS.update({'city_scale_live_record_value_3': {'signature': 'state: SceneState, inputs: CityScaleLiveRecordValue3Input', 'returns': 'CityScaleLiveRecordValue3Result', 'flow': "checked_state(state)\nif type(inputs) is not CityScaleLiveRecordValue3Input:\n    raise ValueError('function-specific historical presentation input required')\ninputs.validate(state)\nconditions = int(inputs.carry) | (2 if inputs.overflow else 0) | (4 if inputs.zero else 0) | (8 if inputs.negative else 0)\nstate.sr = state.sr & 65520 | conditions\nframe = first_replace(FirstDeploymentFrame.unobserved(), target_x=inputs.value, unit=inputs.tile)\nframe = city_scale_live_record_value_3_fields(state, frame)\nreturn CityScaleLiveRecordValue3Result(destination=state.table_at(frame.roster.base), value=frame.target_x, field=frame.target_y, tile=frame.unit, carry=bool(state.sr & 1), zero=bool(state.sr & 4), negative=bool(state.sr & 8), overflow=bool(state.sr & 2)).validate(state)"}})

